                    briefing_title_r2:      `Round 2 — Openness modes, partners & the Tritón deal`,
                    briefing_text_r2:       `Now allocate the <strong>€19.2M R&D budget</strong> across openness modes and pick the partner to build the network around. Open innovation <em>rebalances</em> the budget — fund internal where Lumen genuinely leads, license in for speed, out-license the dormant periphery — it does not abdicate to outsourcing nor cling to 100% internal. Choose a lead partner from the slate (the contested spin-out, the Korean shipyard, an accelerator, a CRO) weighing capability, reliability, cost and <em>strategic-leakage</em> risk. Then make the Tritón inbound deal concrete: license the spin-out's enzyme now — <strong>€2.8M upfront + 6% royalty, launch in 8 months</strong> — or finish internally and arrive late.`,
